WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.980
The Rose of Versailles

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.980
The Rose of Versailles

00:00:16.500 --> 00:00:19.620
I beg you! I am Boehmer, the jeweler!

00:00:19.940 --> 00:00:23.120
When does Your Majesty plan
on making the payments?!

00:00:23.120 --> 00:00:26.750
The payments for the necklace
you purchased from me!

00:00:26.750 --> 00:00:27.810
I can't wait any longer!

00:00:27.810 --> 00:00:29.130
Please make the payments immediately!

00:00:30.050 --> 00:00:32.130
I'm on the verge of bankruptcy!

00:00:32.420 --> 00:00:36.140
Please pay the 1,600,000 livres for the necklace!

00:00:36.140 --> 00:00:38.350
Your Majesty, Queen Marie Antoinette!

00:00:40.160 --> 00:00:42.330
Something concerning the Queen?

00:00:42.330 --> 00:00:43.360
Just what is the matter?

00:00:46.930 --> 00:00:47.740
Your Majesty!

00:00:48.890 --> 00:00:51.730
His Majesty has asked you to come to
the Palace of Versailles immediately.

00:00:58.110 --> 00:00:59.340
Cardinal Rohan!

00:01:02.680 --> 00:01:05.480
You are ordered to appear
at the Palace of Versailles!

00:01:12.520 --> 00:01:15.820
<i>August 15, 1785,</i>

00:01:16.390 --> 00:01:19.600
<i>marked the beginning of the
"Affair of the Diamond Necklace",</i>

00:01:19.600 --> 00:01:22.470
<i>the most infamous incident
in French criminal history.</i>

