00:23:49.950 --> 00:23:53.460
<i>Oscar is suspected of helping
Jeanne with her prison escape.</i>

00:23:54.200 --> 00:23:57.870
<i>''I must save Lady Oscar somehow,''
agonizes Rosalie.</i>

00:23:58.210 --> 00:24:01.830
<i>Then one day, her loathsome mother
visits and offers her a helping hand,</i>

00:24:02.210 --> 00:24:04.580
<i>in exchange for her to join the Polignac family.</i>

